Package: quickped
Title: Interactive Pedigree Creation and Analysis
Version: 4.6.0
Authors@R:
    person("Magnus Dehli", "Vigeland", , "m.d.vigeland@medisin.uio.no",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9134-4962"))
Description: A 'shiny' application for creating, editing and plotting
    pedigrees, described in Vigeland (2022) <doi:10.1186/s12859-022-04759-y>.
    Pedigrees can be built interactively or imported from text files, and
    exported as images, pedigree files or R code. Relatedness analyses
    include kinship and identity coefficients, verbal descriptions of
    relationships and relatedness triangle plots. The application is
    built on the 'pedsuite' packages for pedigree analysis.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://magnusdv.shinyapps.io/quickped/,
    https://github.com/magnusdv/quickped
